## Key Concepts

- Privacy-preserving PCA (DP-PCA) and its variance impact
- Per-tenant calibration vs global projection
- Drift detection in loadings and explained variance
- Latency budgeting in streaming analytics
- Evaluation metrics: epsilon, explained variance, alert fidelity

## Code Example

```javascript
// Skeleton: placeholder for a privacy-preserving online PCA kernel
function dpPcaStep(X, epsilon, clip) {
  const Xc = clipFeatures(X, -clip, clip);
  const C = covariance(Xc);
  const noise = sampleGaussianNoise(C.size, sensitivity(C), epsilon);
  return eigenDecompose(addMatrices(C, noise));
}
```

